{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:BringsSurface.DefectLegendrianKnot","@type":"LeanModule","name":"BringsSurface.DefectLegendrianKnot","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Monoidal.Category","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Category.Basic"],"declarations":1,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.defect_legendrian_knot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.defect_legendrian_knot","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/defect-legendrian-knot.lean#L38-L54","doc":"The Legendrian condition on the unit-particle defect, as a **predicate**\non the categorical data: the contact form `θ`, post-composed with the\ndefect support `supp`, agrees with the (given) `zero` morphism composed\nwith `supp` — i.e. `θ` vanishes on `supp` in the categorical sense\n`θ ≫ supp = zero ≫ supp`.\n\nNamed (§3b), not asserted: the previous `(h_contact : P) : P := h_contact`\nwas self-assuming and stated nothing. The full geometric content — that\n`supp(Li_q)` is Legendrian in the contact 3-manifold `L_q` — requires the\nq-torsion leaf structure from the Reeb derivation, not available at this\nlevel of abstraction, so this names the condition rather than proving it. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:defect-legendrian-knot","label":"conj:defect-legendrian-knot","md":"quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/defect-legendrian-knot.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}